tter-spacing: 0.0px;color:var(--ds-text,#000000);">The naming convention is=
:&nbsp; Project Number =E2=80=93 Project Name =E2=80=93 PCD =E2=80=93 Work =
Package Number</em></p><p style=3D"margin-left: 80.0px;"><span style=3D"col=
or:var(--ds-text,#172b4d);">In this diagram, the arrows represent the<span>=
