izing which system component initiates the interaction (typically an API ca=
ll or pull/push request). They do&nbsp;</span><strong style=3D"text-align: =
left;">not</strong><span style=3D"color:var(--ds-text,#172b4d);"><span>&nbs=
p;</span>represent the data flow or the actual network routing paths, altho=
ugh in some case, the logical direction of invocation may align with the ph=
ysical data path.</span></p><p style=3D"margin-left: 80.0px;">The new chang=
