.0px;"><span style=3D"color:var(--ds-background-accent-blue-bolder,#0c66e4)=
;">The Amazon Connect Customer Data Lake is AWS created and Managed resourc=
e and Amazon Connect Customer uses AWS RAM to shares its data tables to oth=
