ibility at scale. It also supports resource-based policy.&nbsp;<br><br>The =
Amazon Connect Customer data in PCI account (Owning/Sharing account) will s=
hare the data to non-PCI account (Consuming Account) where Quick Sight &amp=
; Athena shall be provisioned.&nbsp; </span><span style=3D"letter-spacing: =
0.0px;color:var(--ds-background-accent-blue-bolder,#0c66e4);">AWS RAM is PC=
I-DSS compliant, however there is no data share (tables) has PCI data.</spa=
n></p><p style=3D"margin-left: 40.0px;">See the one time process for enabli=
